WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.251 --> 00:00:02.771
- We've got Amy Schumer in the house!

00:00:02.771 --> 00:00:05.102
- The college instinct in me is like--

00:00:05.102 --> 00:00:07.442
- And the college instinct is right!

00:00:07.442 --> 00:00:09.282
- This is exactly what
we wanted you to do!

00:00:09.282 --> 00:00:10.622
- Is that true?
- Yeah.

00:00:10.622 --> 00:00:13.442
- Amy Schumer didn't even
have to explain the game!

00:00:13.442 --> 00:00:15.222
- Guys, I went to a state school.

00:00:15.222 --> 00:00:17.401
- We are here on the Emmy's
red carpet finding out

00:00:17.401 --> 00:00:19.082
the most important thing.

00:00:19.082 --> 00:00:20.942
- And that is, who's the best at flip cup?

00:00:20.942 --> 00:00:22.082
Let's find out.

00:00:22.082 --> 00:00:23.942
You guys look like a
great team, obviously.

00:00:23.942 --> 00:00:25.362
You probably can work together well.

00:00:25.362 --> 00:00:27.262
Have you ever played flip cup before?

00:00:27.262 --> 00:00:29.122
Where you try to flip the cup
over, so put it on the edge

00:00:29.122 --> 00:00:30.222
there.
- Yeah?

00:00:30.222 --> 00:00:31.382
- Actually, flip it back over.

00:00:31.382 --> 00:00:33.642
- You hold the cup like
this, you flip it and it has

00:00:33.642 --> 00:00:34.562
to land.

00:00:34.562 --> 00:00:36.982
- I am a lesbian, if it's
a competition, I'm in!

00:00:36.982 --> 00:00:38.102
- I haven't played this in years.

00:00:38.102 --> 00:00:40.412
- Good luck.

00:00:40.412 --> 00:00:41.202
- Damn.

00:00:41.202 --> 00:00:42.862
- That counts, yeah?
- Yes!

00:00:42.862 --> 00:00:45.662
- Aw, crap.

00:00:45.662 --> 00:00:47.522
- Was that good?

00:00:47.522 --> 00:00:50.362
- Slo-mo, I did it in
slo-mo, that was amazing.

00:00:50.362 --> 00:00:52.042
- Let's give it a go!

00:00:54.092 --> 00:00:55.852
- I never played before.

00:01:00.472 --> 00:01:01.742
(all cheering)

00:01:01.742 --> 00:01:02.922
- With the assist!

00:01:02.922 --> 00:01:05.732
- Cheater, liar, cheater.

00:01:05.732 --> 00:01:07.932
- No, I lose.

00:01:07.932 --> 00:01:10.162
- Oh my God.

00:01:10.162 --> 00:01:13.692
- Yes, queen, yes, queen!

00:01:15.162 --> 00:01:16.513
- That was so sad.

00:01:16.513 --> 00:01:19.023
- No, that's it.

00:01:20.773 --> 00:01:22.113
- I like this game a lot more.

00:01:22.113 --> 00:01:23.733
- A little aggressive, okay, alright.

00:01:23.733 --> 00:01:25.393
- Sorry I'm so good at everything, guys.

00:01:25.393 --> 00:01:26.973
- This is getting physical.

00:01:26.973 --> 00:01:29.873
- Get it, I have to get it!

00:01:29.873 --> 00:01:32.713
- You know the college I
visited, I went to Towson

00:01:32.713 --> 00:01:36.813
University in Baltimore, I
went and visited and I won

00:01:36.813 --> 00:01:39.993
a flip cup tournament and
that's why I went there, so.

00:01:39.993 --> 00:01:41.313
- Scholarship?

00:01:41.313 --> 00:01:42.953
- Scholarship, full ride.

00:01:42.953 --> 00:01:45.063
- That's a crazy school.
- Don't remember a day of it.

